# Unminute's direct runtime dependencies, for Windows x64 and CPython 3.12.
# requirements.lock is generated from this file by tools/lock.py and pins every
# package, direct or not, with its SHA-256 hashes. Edit this file, then run
#   python tools/lock.py
# and commit both. Change dependencies only as a compatible set with Windows
# wheels (AGENTS.md, "Checks"), and adopt a new version only after it has been
# public for at least 7 days.

